                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi ndapa mulazyo wakuti, kufumbwa muntu uusandula ijwi eli, zisamu zigwisigwe muŋanda yakwe akwiimikwa kuti aanzikwe alinzizyo, alimwi iŋanda yakwe ibe mbolezi nkaambo kamakani aya. ",
