        {
          "text": "Bapati baba-Juda bakayaka, nkabela bakacita kabotu nkaambo kakusinsima kwamusinsimi Hagai akwa-Zekariya mwana wa-Ido. Bakayaka mane lumwi bakamana mbubonya mbwaakalailila Leza waIsrayeli, ambubakalaililwa a-Koresi, a-Dariyo, a-Aritasasta mwami wa-Persia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
