          "text": "Kupobwe lyakusalazya iŋanda ya-Leza bakatuula zipaizyo, basune bali mwanda, bagutu bali myanda yobile, tubelele tuli myanda yone; ampongo zyacipaizyo cakutontozya cakupaizizya zibi zyaba-Israyeli boonse zyakali ikumi azibili mbubonya mbuli mweelwe wamisyobo yabana ba-Israyeli. ",
